  Parameters: {"authenticity_token" => "[FILTERED]", "project" => {"name" => "Connect Sphere", "description" => "Connect Sphere is a modern social networking platform designed to connect people through shared content, real-time interaction, and personalized user experiences. Inspired by popular social media applications, the platform allows users to create profiles, upload photos and videos, follow other users, and engage through likes, comments, and direct messaging.\n\nThe system is built around a robust and scalable database structure that efficiently manages user data, posts, relationships, and interactions. It includes key features such as user authentication, news feed generation, content storage, and social graph management (followers/following). The database is designed using relational concepts to ensure data consistency, integrity, and fast retrieval.\n\nCore modules include:\n\nUser Management: Registration, login, profile updates\nPost Management: Upload, edit, delete posts (images/videos)\nInteraction System: Likes, comments, and shares\nFollow System: User relationships and social graph\nMessaging: Private chat between users\nFeed Algorithm: Displays personalized content based on user activity\n\nThe project demonstrates practical implementation of database design concepts such as normalization, relationships (one-to-many, many-to-many), indexing, and query optimization. It aims to provide a seamless and engaging user experience while maintaining efficient backend performance."}, "commit" => "Create Project"}
